# Hamro3D — Dusk Violet Memory Design System (Nuxt Edition)

Design direction: *The color of the hour between day and memory. Where things become precious.*

## Color Palette

### Core Hierarchy (Tailwind token → HEX)
| Tailwind Class | Role | HEX |
|---------------|------|-----|
| `bg-h3d-base` / `text-h3d-base` | Background (Deep Plum) | `#1A0E24` |
| `bg-h3d-surface` | Cards, modals | `#271540` |
| `text-h3d-text` | Primary text (Warm Cream) | `#F2EDE8` |
| `text-h3d-muted` | Secondary text (Lavender Grey) | `#A898B8` |
| `border-h3d-border` | Borders, dividers | `#3A2450` |

### Accent & Functional
| Tailwind Class | Role | HEX |
|---------------|------|-----|
| `bg-h3d-accent` / `text-h3d-accent` | CTAs, highlights (Aged Rose Gold) | `#C4907A` |
| `hover:bg-h3d-accent-hover` | Hover states | `#A07060` |
| `text-h3d-success` | Confirmation | `#6B8A70` |
| `text-h3d-error` / `bg-h3d-error` | Critical feedback | `#8B2A3A` |

### Usage Ratio
- 70% Deep Plum (backgrounds, atmosphere)
- 20% Violet Mid + Lavender (containers, readable areas)
- 10% Rose Gold (CTAs, emotional highlights)

### NEVER
- Use bright purple (reads as tech startup)
- Use pure white — always warm cream `text-h3d-text` / `#F2EDE8`
- Use cold/blue-white tones anywhere
- Use `rounded-lg` or larger — brand is precise (max `rounded-sm` / 3px)

## Typography

### Font Stack (Tailwind classes)
- **Display / Emotional:** `font-h3d-display` → EB Garamond (serif)
- **Structural / UI:** `font-h3d-body` → Jost (sans-serif)
- **Devanagari Display:** `font-h3d-devanagari` → Rozha One
- **Devanagari Body:** `font-h3d-devanagari-body` → Noto Sans Devanagari

### Scale
| Level | Tailwind Classes | Use |
|-------|-----------------|-----|
| H1 | `font-h3d-display text-h3d-hero leading-[1.18]` | Hero headlines |
| H2 | `font-h3d-display text-h3d-h2` | Section headers |
| H3 | `font-h3d-body text-h3d-h3 font-medium tracking-[0.06em]` | Sub-sections |
| H4 | `font-h3d-body text-h3d-h4` | Card titles |
| H5 | `font-h3d-body text-h3d-h5 uppercase tracking-[0.2em]` | Labels, categories |
| Lead | `font-h3d-display text-h3d-lead leading-[1.8]` | Intro paragraphs |
| Body | `font-h3d-body text-h3d-body leading-[1.82]` | Primary body text |
| CTA | `font-h3d-body text-h3d-cta font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.22em]` | Buttons |
| Nav | `font-h3d-body text-h3d-nav font-medium tracking-[0.1em]` | Navigation |

### Typography Rules
- Headlines use natural letter-spacing, not tight
- CTAs and labels: ALL CAPS with wide tracking
- Body line-height: 1.82
- Quote text: EB Garamond Italic, rose gold tint, centered

## Visual Effects

### Gradients (Tailwind arbitrary values)
```html
<!-- Hero "velvet spotlight" -->
<div class="bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_65%_40%,var(--color-h3d-surface)_0%,var(--color-h3d-base)_75%)]">

<!-- Center glow -->
<div class="bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_50%_50%,var(--color-h3d-surface)_0%,var(--color-h3d-base)_80%)]">
```

### Shadows
Use `shadow-h3d-card` (defined in theme) for card and modal elevation.

### Glass / Transparency
```html
<div class="backdrop-blur-[14px] bg-[rgba(39,21,64,0.9)]">
```

### Texture
Soft-light grain overlay at 6–10% opacity on dark surfaces (via CSS pseudo-element or texture image).

## Layout Grid

- 12-column grid, `gap-h3d-gutter` (24px), `max-w-h3d-max` (1240px)
- Text containers: `max-w-h3d-text` (660px) centered
- Product grid: `max-w-h3d-grid` (1100px)
- Section vertical spacing: `py-h3d-section` (clamp 80–220px)
- 8px base spacing unit

## Vue Component Patterns

### H3dProductCard
```vue
<template>
  <NuxtLink
    :to="`/piece/${piece.id}`"
    class="block bg-h3d-surface border border-h3d-border transition-colors duration-300 hover:border-h3d-accent"
  >
    <div class="aspect-[4/5] bg-h3d-base flex items-center justify-center border-b border-h3d-border">
      <NuxtPicture :src="piece.image" :alt="piece.altText" format="webp" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
    <div class="p-h3d-md space-y-2">
      <span class="font-h3d-body text-h3d-h5 uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-h3d-accent">
        {{ piece.collection }}
      </span>
      <h3 class="font-h3d-display italic text-h3d-text text-h3d-h4">
        {{ piece.name }}
      </h3>
      <span class="font-h3d-body text-h3d-body-sm text-h3d-muted">
        NPR {{ piece.price }}
      </span>
    </div>
  </NuxtLink>
</template>
```

### H3dButton
- Primary: `bg-h3d-accent text-h3d-base hover:bg-h3d-accent-hover` + CTA typography
- Secondary: `border border-h3d-border text-h3d-muted hover:border-h3d-accent hover:text-h3d-text bg-transparent` + italic display font
- Always include `focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-h3d-accent focus-visible:outline-offset-2`

### H3dHero
- Full-bleed dusk atmosphere with radial glow gradient
- Rose gold rule line (`border-b border-h3d-accent`) beneath headline
- Arrival should feel like entering a gifting space

## Animation

- Warm fade-up reveals: `duration-700 ease-out`, staggered
- Use the `h3d-animate-in` utility class (defined in main.css)
- Transitions feel like "gifts appearing under warm light"
- No jarring or snappy animations
- Always respect `prefers-reduced-motion`:
  ```html
  <div class="h3d-animate-in motion-reduce:!animate-none motion-reduce:opacity-100">
  ```
